sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Organize groups and activities
    %% Stories: 6, 13, 25, 26, 27, 28, 29, 34, 35
    %% Description: The camp administrator creates groups, schedules activities for a group in a facility, changes scheduled activities, tracks the usage of the camp facilities and views the groups of the camp with their events.
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    participant GR as Group
    participant CA as Camper
    participant SC as Schedule
    participant AC as Activity
    participant FA as Facility
    participant CM as Camp

    %% covers 25
    AD->>GR: create group and add campers
    GR->>CA: campers of the group
    %% covers 34
    AD->>GR: modify group information
    %% covers 6, 27
    AD->>GR: schedule activity for the group
    GR->>SC: group schedule
    SC->>AC: scheduled activity
    AC->>FA: facility used
    %% covers 13
    AD->>CM: track facility usage
    CM->>FA: facilities
    %% covers 28, 29
    AD->>SC: modify or delete scheduled activity
    %% covers 26, 35
    AD->>CM: view groups and their events
    CM->>GR: groups
